# Spread Operator (`...`) with Objects 🪄

Merge and override object properties effortlessly:

```javascript
const defaultTheme = {
  mode: "light",
  fontSize: 14,
  fontFamily: "sans-serif"
};

const userCustomization = {
  mode: "dark",      // Overrides defaultTheme.mode!
  fontSize: 16
};

// Merge: rightmost properties overwrite earlier properties!
const finalTheme = { ...defaultTheme, ...userCustomization };
console.log(finalTheme);
```

