# ES6 Classes & Constructors 🏛️

ES6 classes provide a clean, syntax-sugar layer over JavaScript's prototypical inheritance:

```javascript
class User {
  constructor(name, email) {
    this.name = name;
    this.email = email;
  }

  // Instance method
  login() {
    console.log(`${this.name} has logged in.`);
  }
}

const alice = new User("Alice", "alice@example.com");
alice.login();
```

