# Getters and Setters 🛡️

Encapsulate and validate property access:

```javascript
class Temperature {
  constructor(celsius) {
    this._celsius = celsius;
  }

  // Getter
  get fahrenheit() {
    return this._celsius * 1.8 + 32;
  }

  // Setter
  set celsius(value) {
    if (value < -273.15) {
      throw new Error("Below absolute zero is physically impossible!");
    }
    this._celsius = value;
  }
}

const temp = new Temperature(25);
console.log("Fahrenheit:", temp.fahrenheit); // 77
```

