# Static Methods (`static`) ⚡

Static methods belong directly to the Class itself, not to instances of the class:

```javascript
class MathUtils {
  static square(n) {
    return n * n;
  }

  static cube(n) {
    return n * n * n;
  }
}

// Call directly without writing 'new MathUtils()'!
console.log(MathUtils.square(5)); // 25
console.log(MathUtils.cube(3));   // 27
```

