# Optional Chaining (`?.`) 🔗

Safely navigate deep nested objects without throwing `TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined`!

```javascript
const response = {
  data: {
    user: {
      profile: {
        avatar: "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
      }
    }
  }
};

// Safe deep access
const avatarUrl = response?.data?.user?.profile?.avatar;
console.log("Avatar:", avatarUrl);

// If missing, returns undefined safely without crashing!
const twitterHandle = response?.data?.user?.social?.twitter;
console.log("Twitter:", twitterHandle); // undefined
```

