# Sets: Unique Value Collections 💎

A `Set` is a collection of **strictly unique values**. Any duplicate values are automatically rejected!

```javascript
const tagSet = new Set(["coding", "javascript", "coding", "web"]);
console.log("Set size:", tagSet.size); // 3 (duplicate "coding" was dropped!)

// One-liner to remove duplicates from an array:
const duplicateList = [1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 4, 5];
const uniqueList = [...new Set(duplicateList)];

console.log("Unique array:", uniqueList); // [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
```

