# Modern String Methods 🔤

Convenient string validation methods:

```javascript
const filename = "invoice_2026.pdf";

console.log(filename.startsWith("invoice")); // true
console.log(filename.endsWith(".pdf"));      // true
console.log(filename.includes("2026"));      // true

const paddedNumber = "7".padStart(4, "0");  // "0007"
console.log("Padded number:", paddedNumber);
```

