# Array Utilities: Array.from and Array.isArray 📐

Convert array-like objects (like `NodeList` or `arguments`) into real arrays:

```javascript
// Convert Set or String to array
const letters = Array.from("HELLO");
console.log(letters); // ["H", "E", "L", "L", "O"]

// Safe array check
console.log(Array.isArray([1, 2, 3])); // true
console.log(Array.isArray({ length: 3 })); // false
```

